### Defect Analysis & Production Scrap Metrics

| Defect Type | Frequency (per 10,000m) | Avg. Scrap Rate (%) | ASTM D5430 Penalty Points | Primary Root Cause / Machine Component | Corrective Action |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Broken Pick** | 42 | 4.8% | 4 Points / meter | Weft insertion failure, main nozzle air pressure drop | Check main nozzle pressure (4.5-5.2 bar) and electronic feeler pin. |
| **Oil Stain** | 28 | 3.2% | 2 Points / meter | Lubricant leakage from loom crankcase or heald frame guides | Inspect oil seals, clean guide rails, use approved non-staining scouring agents. |
| **Slub / Thick End** | 22 | 2.1% | 2 Points / meter | Raw yarn irregularity, spinning room contamination | Check yarn clearers on winding and incoming raw material bale quality. |
| **Mispick** | 15 | 1.8% | 2 Points / meter | Timing error between shed opening and rapier/air insertion | Synchronize pick timing and check harness cord wear. |
| **Warp Float** | 12 | 1.0% | 1 Point / meter | Heddle wire tangle or broken warp stop wire | Clear tangled heddles and replace fallen drop wires on the warp stop motion. |

